WEBVTT

00:00:10.035 --> 00:00:12.195
So, as it turns out, the green trash can

00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:14.275
is not recycling, it's for greens.

00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:15.995
-Like compost. And eggshells.
-Mmm.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:17.755
And the blue one is recycling.

00:00:17.835 --> 00:00:19.715
-MOM: And the black one is trash.
-Riley is acting so weird.

00:00:19.795 --> 00:00:20.835
Why is she acting so weird?

00:00:20.955 --> 00:00:23.235
What do you expect?
All the Islands are down.

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.395
Joy would know what to do.

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:25.635
That's it.

00:00:25.795 --> 00:00:28.515
Until she gets back,
we just do what Joy would do!

00:00:28.635 --> 00:00:31.275
Great idea. Anger, Fear, Disgust,

00:00:31.595 --> 00:00:32.875
how are we supposed to be happy?

00:00:33.395 --> 00:00:35.395
MOM: Hey, Riley. I've got good news!

00:00:35.555 --> 00:00:38.395
I found a junior hockey league
right here in San Francisco.

00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:40.475
And get this: Try-outs are tomorrow

00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:42.475
after school. What luck, right?

00:00:42.595 --> 00:00:43.875
-Hockey?
-Uh-oh. What do we do?

00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:45.515
(STUTTERING) Guys, this is...

00:00:45.635 --> 00:00:46.755
You pretend to be Joy.

00:00:46.835 --> 00:00:48.715
Won't it be great to be
back out on the ice?

00:00:50.755 --> 00:00:52.995
Oh, yeah, that sounds fantastic.

00:00:53.915 --> 00:00:55.755
What was that?
That wasn't anything like Joy!

00:00:55.915 --> 00:00:58.115
-Uh, because I'm not Joy.
-Yeah, no kidding.

00:01:00.395 --> 00:01:01.675
Did you guys pick up on that?

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.515
-Mmm-hmm. Something's wrong.
-Totally.

00:01:03.635 --> 00:01:04.835
Should we ask her?

00:01:04.915 --> 00:01:06.635
Let's probe. But keep it subtle,

00:01:06.715 --> 00:01:07.755
so she doesn't notice.

00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:10.035
So, how was the first day of school?

00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:11.355
She's probing us.

00:01:11.475 --> 00:01:12.715
I'm done. You pretend to be Joy.

00:01:12.835 --> 00:01:15.155
What? Okay. Um, hmm.

00:01:15.635 --> 00:01:18.635
It was fine, I guess. I don't know.

00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:21.395
Oh. Very smooth. That was just like Joy.

00:01:21.715 --> 00:01:23.555
Something is definitely going on.

00:01:23.675 --> 00:01:26.075
She's never acted like this before.
What should we do?

00:01:26.435 --> 00:01:27.675
We're going to
find out what's happening.

00:01:27.795 --> 00:01:29.075
But we'll need support.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.155
Signal the husband.

00:01:31.115 --> 00:01:32.195
Ahem!

00:01:33.835 --> 00:01:35.875
ANNOUNCER: With a nice
pass over to Reeves,

00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:37.275
comes across ...and nice!

00:01:37.995 --> 00:01:38.995
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:40.915 --> 00:01:44.395
Uh-oh. She's looking at us.
Uh, what did she say?

00:01:44.555 --> 00:01:46.795
What? Oh! Sorry, sir.
No one was listening.

00:01:47.115 --> 00:01:49.195
Is it garbage night?
We left the toilet seat up?

00:01:49.315 --> 00:01:51.075
What? What is it, woman? What?

00:01:51.355 --> 00:01:53.355
Ugh, he's making that stupid face again.

00:01:53.475 --> 00:01:55.235
MOM'S ANGER: I could
strangle him right now.

00:01:55.475 --> 00:01:56.555
Signal him again.

00:01:59.195 --> 00:02:01.915
Ah! So, Riley, how was school?

00:02:02.075 --> 00:02:03.915
-You got to be kidding me!
-Seriously?

00:02:04.075 --> 00:02:06.875
For this we gave up
that Brazilian helicopter pilot?

00:02:07.395 --> 00:02:08.875
Move! I'll be Joy.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.075
School was great, all right?

00:02:11.395 --> 00:02:13.235
Riley. Is everything okay?

00:02:13.515 --> 00:02:14.515
Ugh!

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:16.315
Sir, she just rolled her eyes at us.

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:17.915
What is her deal?

00:02:18.115 --> 00:02:19.755
All right, make a show of force.

00:02:19.835 --> 00:02:21.275
I don't want to have to
put "the foot" down.

00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:23.315
No, not the foot!

00:02:23.555 --> 00:02:25.595
Riley, I do not like this new attitude.

00:02:25.795 --> 00:02:27.395
Oh, I'll show you attitude, old man.

00:02:27.515 --> 00:02:28.875
No. No, no, no! Stay happy!

00:02:29.635 --> 00:02:31.755
What is your problem?
Just leave me alone!

00:02:31.835 --> 00:02:33.595
Sir, reporting high levels of sass!

00:02:34.075 --> 00:02:35.555
Take it to DEFCON Two.

00:02:35.635 --> 00:02:37.675
You heard that, gentlemen.
DEFCON Two.

00:02:37.755 --> 00:02:38.835
(ALARMS BLARING)

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:40.435
Listen, young lady, I don't know where

00:02:40.555 --> 00:02:42.555
this disrespectful attitude came from...

00:02:42.635 --> 00:02:44.155
You want a piece of this, pops?

00:02:44.275 --> 00:02:45.395
Come and get it!

00:02:45.595 --> 00:02:46.995
Yeah, well... Well...

00:02:47.275 --> 00:02:49.395
Here it comes. Prepare the foot!

00:02:50.955 --> 00:02:52.355
Keys to safety position.

00:02:54.315 --> 00:02:55.635
Ready to launch on your command, sir!

00:02:57.155 --> 00:02:58.475
(YELLING)

00:02:58.595 --> 00:03:00.115
Just shut up!

00:03:01.275 --> 00:03:02.355
Fire!

00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:06.435
That's it! Go to your room! Now!

00:03:06.515 --> 00:03:07.515
Uh!

00:03:08.715 --> 00:03:09.715
(RILEY GRUNTING)

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:12.595
The foot is down! The foot is down!

00:03:12.675 --> 00:03:13.875
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:14.115 --> 00:03:15.675
Good job, gentlemen.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.275
That could have been a disaster.

00:03:18.155 --> 00:03:19.555
Well, that was a disaster.

00:03:23.035 --> 00:03:25.835
Come fly with me, gatinha.

00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:28.195
(ALL SIGH)

00:03:31.355 --> 00:03:32.795
(RUMBLING)

00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:37.835
(JOY SIGHS)

00:03:38.275 --> 00:03:40.675
We're going to walk out there? On that?

00:03:41.115 --> 00:03:42.715
JOY: It's the quickest way back.

00:03:42.835 --> 00:03:44.755
But it's right over the Memory Dump.

00:03:44.915 --> 00:03:47.115
If we fall, we'll be forgotten forever.

00:03:47.395 --> 00:03:51.155
We have to do this for Riley.
Just follow my footsteps.

00:03:51.235 --> 00:03:52.675
-Oh, okay.
-It's not that high.

00:03:52.755 --> 00:03:54.715
It's totally fine...

00:03:59.715 --> 00:04:01.275
(JOY GRUNTING)

00:04:03.155 --> 00:04:04.235
No!

00:04:04.355 --> 00:04:05.395
(GRUNTS)

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:08.515
-(KNOCK ON DOOR)
-(DOOR OPENS)

00:04:10.955 --> 00:04:11.995
Hey.

00:04:12.955 --> 00:04:15.915
So, uh, things got a little
out of hand downstairs.

00:04:17.035 --> 00:04:18.315
Do you want to talk about it?

00:04:19.835 --> 00:04:22.035
Come on, where's my happy girl?

00:04:23.875 --> 00:04:25.635
Monkey.
(IMITATING MONKEY GRUNTING)

00:04:25.955 --> 00:04:27.875
Oh, he's trying to start up Goofball.

00:04:28.995 --> 00:04:29.995
DAD: Come on!

00:04:30.275 --> 00:04:32.755
(DAD CONTINUES GRUNTING)

00:04:35.395 --> 00:04:36.555
(RUMBLING)

00:04:36.835 --> 00:04:38.315
(GRUNTS)

00:04:40.635 --> 00:04:41.675
(GASPS) Ah!

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.115
Go back! Run, run, run!

00:04:46.315 --> 00:04:47.355
(JOY PANTING)

00:04:54.075 --> 00:04:55.075
(GASPS)

00:05:08.395 --> 00:05:09.995
(BOTH PANTING)

00:05:12.315 --> 00:05:13.395
What...

00:05:29.075 --> 00:05:31.715
I get it. You need some alone time.

00:05:34.635 --> 00:05:35.835
We'll talk later.

00:05:39.675 --> 00:05:41.115
DISGUST: We have a major problem.

00:05:41.235 --> 00:05:43.115
FEAR: Oh, Joy, where are you?

00:05:44.555 --> 00:05:46.595
SADNESS: We lost Goofball Island.

00:05:47.315 --> 00:05:48.795
That means she can lose Friendship

00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:51.035
and Hockey and Honesty and Family.

00:05:52.155 --> 00:05:53.955
You can fix this, right, Joy?

00:05:54.675 --> 00:05:57.395
I, uh... I don't know.

00:05:57.515 --> 00:05:59.155
-Oh...
-But we have to try.

00:05:59.435 --> 00:06:00.475
Okay, come on.

00:06:00.555 --> 00:06:01.755
(MACHINERY POWERING DOWN)

00:06:01.835 --> 00:06:03.755
-Riley's gone to sleep.
-Oh...

00:06:03.835 --> 00:06:06.315
Which is a good thing.

00:06:06.475 --> 00:06:07.715
When you think about it because

00:06:07.835 --> 00:06:09.835
nothing else bad
can happen while she's asleep.

00:06:09.955 --> 00:06:11.995
We'll be back to Headquarters
before she wakes up.

00:06:12.235 --> 00:06:14.595
We'll just go across Friendship Island.

00:06:17.035 --> 00:06:18.355
Oh, we'll never make it.

00:06:18.475 --> 00:06:19.515
-Oh, no!
-No, no, no!

00:06:19.755 --> 00:06:21.235
Don't obsess over
the weight of life's problems.

00:06:21.355 --> 00:06:23.195
Remember the funny movie
where the dog dies?

00:06:23.355 --> 00:06:25.835
Oh, Sadness,
we don't have time for this.

00:06:25.995 --> 00:06:29.155
We'll just have to go around.
Take the scenic route.

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:31.915
SADNESS: Wait, Joy,
you could get lost in there!

00:06:32.235 --> 00:06:33.595
Think positive!

00:06:33.835 --> 00:06:37.155
SADNESS: Okay. I'm positive
you will get lost in there.

00:06:37.755 --> 00:06:39.515
SADNESS: That's Long Term Memory.

00:06:39.995 --> 00:06:42.155
An endless warren
of corridors and shelves.

00:06:42.235 --> 00:06:43.835
I read about it in the manuals.

00:06:44.835 --> 00:06:46.395
The manuals?

00:06:46.555 --> 00:06:47.635
The manuals!

00:06:47.715 --> 00:06:49.515
-You read the manuals!
-Yeah.

00:06:49.635 --> 00:06:51.555
So you know
the way back to Headquarters!

00:06:51.995 --> 00:06:53.075
I guess.

00:06:53.235 --> 00:06:54.995
Ooh! (CHUCKLES EXCITEDLY)

00:06:55.995 --> 00:06:57.115
You are my map!

00:06:57.395 --> 00:06:59.595
Let's go! Lead on, my map!

00:06:59.675 --> 00:07:00.755
Show me where we're going!

00:07:00.875 --> 00:07:04.595
Okay. Only I'm too sad to walk.

00:07:04.675 --> 00:07:07.395
Just give me a few...hours.

00:07:07.675 --> 00:07:08.675
Ooh!

00:07:09.435 --> 00:07:10.515
JOY: Which way? Left?

00:07:10.675 --> 00:07:11.755
SADNESS: Right.

00:07:12.115 --> 00:07:13.395
No. I mean, go left.

00:07:13.515 --> 00:07:15.355
I said left was right. Like "correct."

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:16.555
JOY: Okay.

00:07:16.835 --> 00:07:18.715
SADNESS: This actually
feels kind of nice.

00:07:19.035 --> 00:07:20.635
Okay, here we go!

00:07:20.715 --> 00:07:22.835
We'll be back to Headquarters
before morning.

00:07:22.915 --> 00:07:26.435
We can do it! This will be easy!
This is working!

